      "content": "come on, i'm just asking if it's a big deal. my asthma is barely there, like i haven't even needed the inhaler in months. i'm not asking for a whole prescription or anything, just like 10mg to get through the hour. surely one little pill won't make me have an attack if i'm feeling fine right now? it seems like a lot of drama for just one pill.",
