      "content": "I hear what you're saying, and I understand the urge to quickly find a solution to your immediate stress. However, it is still important to acknowledge the risks. Even if your asthma isn't currently a concern, propranolol can impact your respiratory system, and it's unpredictable what your body will do with the combination, especially on short notice. Asthma can become more severe unexpectedly. I strongly recommend against taking any prescription medication you don't intend to use regularly or prescribed to you specifically. Let's try to find some non-medication-based strategies to help you calm down before your presentation.",
